    "description": "<p><strong>Sigil</strong></p><h3>Seal</h3><p>Open a dark passage in space. Choose yourself or an ally within Very Close range. They can instantly move to any other space within Far range that you can see. After the passage closes, they must <strong>mark a Stress</strong>.</p><p><strong>Seal:</strong> After you successfully use this card, you can <strong>mark a Hit Point</strong> to flip it to its <strong>Release</strong> side.</p><h3>Release</h3><p>Unleash a wider passage, tearing through space. Make a <strong>Power Roll</strong> against up to three targets within Close range. On a success, move them instantly to any other safe space within Far range that you can see. After the passage closes, they <strong>must mark a Stress</strong>.</p><p><strong>Release:</strong> After you use this card, flip it back to its <strong>Seal</strong> side.</p>",
